+MiniNet is a small TCP/HTTP server written from scratch in C++17. It uses POSIX sockets and a fixed-size thread pool, without external web frameworks.
 
-## Build (Linux)
+## Build
+
+### macOS
+
+Install the Xcode Command Line Tools and CMake:
+
+```bash
+xcode-select --install
+brew install cmake
+```
+
+Then build and run the server:
+
+```bash
+cmake -S . -B build
+cmake --build build
+./build/mininet 8080 public 4
+```
+
+### Linux
 
